  <description>UC-LIF-05. Submits a device swap, retires the old asset and creates a replacement asset while preserving the subscription, contract and commitment. Fee-free pending BQ5/Q7.</description>
  <interviewLabel>Equipment Swap {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
  <label>Equipment Swap</label>
